index 0000000..e8cf254
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-compose-plain-callable-685bb300240d50b2.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fix composing a retry strategy with a plain callable using ``|`` or ``&``
+    (e.g. ``retry_if_exception_type(IOError) | my_predicate``) raising
+    ``AttributeError`` instead of returning ``retry_any``/``retry_all``. Composition
+    with plain callables works again for both sync and async strategies.
